math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\{f\\in2^\\omega:\\operatorname{DNC}_2(f)\\}\">\\(C=\\{f\\in2^\\omega:\\operatorname{DNC}_2(f)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"26f419e80554b0b9\" href=\"?note=26f419e80554b0b9\" title=\"20-thm-pa-dnc\">20-thm-pa-dnc</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}low\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\ [\\operatorname{Low}_1(A)\\land\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\deg_T(A))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}low\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\ [\\operatorname{Low}_1(A)\\land\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\deg_T(A))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的禁止条件由停止对角计算给出，故有效闭；每个位至少一种值可选，故非空。低基提供低的二值 DNC 成员。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3 与 Low Basis Theorem 的推论；印刷页 185；PDF 第 217 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-pa-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"26f419e80554b0b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-pa-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low-basis","status":"resolved","id":"04a511cfa9ffa494","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-low-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor"